            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Aspects herein relate to an inflatable ball (100, 200), in particular soccer ball, having an outer shell comprising panels (140, 150, 240, 250, 340, 350, 600), wherein the panels (140, 150, 240, 250, 340, 350, 600) comprise at least one surface texture (120, 220),wherein at least a subset of the panels (150, 250, 350, 600) comprises indentations (110, 211, 310, 610) in addition to the surface texture (120, 220), wherein the indentations (110, 211, 310, 610) comprise a shape which is different from a shape of the surface texture (120, 220), and wherein the indentations (110, 211, 310, 610) are polygonal and/or elliptical.</p>
            </abstract>
